{{define "content"}}
<hgroup>
<h1>Scopes</h1>
<p>The catalogue the consent screen shows the scopes by: the standard scopes of OpenID Connect, whose labels alone change, and those of the business, with the claims each covers.</p>
</hgroup>
{{template "notice" .}}
{{- if .CanWrite}}
<p><a href="{{.Base}}/new-scope" role="button">New scope</a></p>
{{- end}}
{{- with .Data}}
<div class="overflow-auto">
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Label</th><th scope="col">Claims</th><th scope="col">Kind</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{- range .Scopes}}
<tr><td><a href="{{$.Base}}/scopes/{{path .Name}}">{{.Name}}</a></td><td>{{.Label}}</td><td>{{range $i, $c := .Claims}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$c}}{{end}}</td><td>{{if .Standard}}standard{{if .Renamed}}, renamed{{end}}{{else}}business{{end}}</td></tr>
{{- end}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2>Overview of the consent</h2>
<form method="get" action="{{$.Base}}/scopes">
<fieldset>
<legend>The scopes a client asks</legend>
{{- range .Scopes}}
<label><input type="checkbox" name="preview" value="{{.Name}}"{{if .Chosen}} checked{{end}}> {{.Name}}</label>
{{- end}}
</fieldset>
<button type="submit" class="secondary">Show the consent</button>
</form>
{{- if .Preview}}
<article>
<p>A client asks for access to the following data (the labels of the default locale, those of the embedded theme by default):</p>
<ul>
{{- range .Preview}}
<li><strong>{{.Label}}</strong>{{with .Claims}}<ul>{{range .}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{end}}</ul>{{end}}</li>
{{- end}}
</ul>
</article>
{{- end}}
{{- if .Error}}
<h2>Scopes asked outside the catalogue</h2>
<p role="alert">{{.Error}}</p>
{{- else if .Scanned}}
<h2>Scopes asked outside the catalogue</h2>
{{- if .Partial}}
<p><mark>The first {{.Partial}} clients of Hydra alone are read: those after them may ask others.</mark></p>
{{- end}}
{{- if .Asked}}
<p>Clients of Hydra ask them: the consent screen shows them by their name, and with the strict filter they send no claim.</p>
<div class="overflow-auto">
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Scope</th><th scope="col">Asked by</th>{{if $.CanWrite}}<th scope="col"></th>{{end}}</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{- range .Asked}}
<tr><td>{{.Scope}}</td><td>{{range $i, $c := .Clients}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$c}}{{end}}</td>{{if $.CanWrite}}<td><a href="{{$.Base}}/new-scope?name={{.Scope}}">Add it</a></td>{{end}}</tr>
{{- end}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
{{- else}}
<p>Every scope the clients of Hydra ask is in the catalogue.</p>
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{end}}
